section
-- Source module: Solutions.J6SegILPreJK12
/-!
# B5 `J` side, part K12: the line tables as `Rn` steps

`stG_spX`: `stG_sp` (J6SegILPre8) with the final registers explicit (`stGV`); the table stage
`tabP = stDI SDI; stDD SDD; stGam SGM; stGi SGI` (`Rn.tabP`).
-/

set_option linter.unusedSectionVars false
set_option linter.unusedVariables false
set_option linter.unusedSimpArgs false

namespace J6Seg.PreT

open IntMul NLogN NLogN.KIL RS IntMul.HvdH

